### main.py — Routes
```
GET  /api/health                 → HealthResponse {"status": "ok", "release": str}
                                   Also probes DB (SELECT 1 FROM food_macros); 503 if unavailable
GET  /api/search?query=str       → list[FoodSearchResult]  ([] if query < 2 chars or > 100)
                                   Rate: 60/min
GET  /api/food/{fdc_id: int}     → FoodDetail              (404 if not found)
                                   Rate: 120/min
POST /api/generate_label         → Response(PDF bytes, media_type="application/pdf")
  Body: GenerateLabelRequest     Rate: 10/min  Timeout: 10s  Concurrency: 2 (semaphore)
  Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="nutrition_label.pdf"
  Errors: 400 (validation / missing fdc_ids) | 429 (rate limit + Retry-After) | 504 (timeout)

Middleware: BodySizeLimitMiddleware (64 KB), TrustedHostMiddleware, CORSMiddleware (dev only)
```

